<title>UK: TABLE-SMITH &amp; NEPHEW H1 PROFITS FALL.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SMITH &amp; NEPHEW H1 PROFITS FALL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.42		   vs 5.68</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.40		   vs 2.29</p>
<p> Pretax		     81.1		   vs 91.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   524.8		  vs 540.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 79.0 and 81.5 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Smith &amp; Nephew Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
